<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">People's Rally for Progress</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1979–present</span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The People's Rally for Progress is the ruling party of Djibouti, founded in 1979 by President <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hassan-gouled-aptidon">Hassan Gouled Aptidon</a>. It was the only legal party from 1981 until a new constitution of 1992 allowed a limited number of parties. Under Ismaïl Omar Guelleh, president since 1999, it has led the governing coalition.</p></div>
